      "viewport": "all",
      "tag": "section",
      "heading": "Where a bot saves you time",
      "items": [
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "THE PROBLEM",
          "role": "sec-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Where a bot saves you time"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Your team answers the same ten questions every day: prices, opening hours, availability, delivery. Orders arrive as private messages, some get lost, and anything that comes in after 6 pm waits until the morning."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "A Telegram bot takes over that routine. It shows the menu or catalogue, collects the order or booking, takes payment and sends a complete request to your team, so a manager only steps in where a person is really needed."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "We build bots as proper applications, with a database, an admin panel and error handling, not as a script that stops working when Telegram changes something. You get the full source code and the bot account."
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "2 wks",
          "role": "cred-val"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Simple bot, from brief to launch",
          "role": "cred-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "1 mo",
          "role": "cred-val"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Support included from Business",
          "role": "cred-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "aiogram 3",
          "role": "cred-val"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Current async framework",
          "role": "cred-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "100%",
          "role": "cred-val"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Code and access handed over",
          "role": "cred-label"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "type": "included-cards",
      "viewport": "all",
      "tag": "section",
      "class": "what",
      "heading": "What goes into a business bot",
      "items": [
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "WHAT'S INCLUDED",
          "role": "sec-label"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What goes into a business bot"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "01",
          "role": "what-num"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Conversation flows"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "We map every step of the dialogue: buttons, questions, branches and what happens if the user leaves halfway. Flows run on a finite state machine with Redis, so conversations do not get stuck.",
          "role": "what-desc"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "FSM · Redis · aiogram 3",
          "role": "what-tags"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "02",
          "role": "what-num"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Database and CRM sync"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Every order or lead is saved to PostgreSQL and sent to your manager. We can also push data to Google Sheets, Notion or your CRM through its API.",
          "role": "what-desc"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "PostgreSQL · Google Sheets · REST API",
          "role": "what-tags"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "03",
          "role": "what-num"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Payments in the chat"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Customers pay without leaving Telegram. We connect Stripe, Telegram Payments, LiqPay, WayForPay or Monobank, with automatic confirmation and receipts.",
          "role": "what-desc"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Stripe · Telegram Payments · LiqPay",
          "role": "what-tags"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "04",
          "role": "what-num"
        },
        {
          "k": "h",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Admin panel and hosting"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "You manage content, orders and broadcasts from an admin menu inside Telegram. The bot is deployed on Railway or your own server, with automatic restarts and error logs.",
          "role": "what-desc"
        },
        {
          "k": "text",
          "text": "Admin bot · Railway · Logging",
          "role": "what-tags"
        }
      ]
    },
